 The fission cross section at 0.0253 eV is different from the     9440 1451     
ENDF/B-VII value and from the Mughabghab value.  There is no      9440 1451     
direct measurement of the fission cross section at 0.0253 eV.     9440 1451     
However,giving the value of -0.003 meV to the fission width of the9440 1451     
resonance at -0.3 eV will bring the 0.0253 ev fission cross       9440 1451     
section at the value of 0.0600 b, with a negligible modification  9440 1451     
of the other thermal cross sections.                              9440 1451     
 In the present evaluation, there is no background cross section  9440 1451     
in the energy range 2680-5700 eV. The corresponding comments      9440 1451     
below for MF=3 are obsolete.                                      9440 1451     
